                                                "sense_id": "7459bcba-6856-3e5f-91e6-c45f6bdbcfc5",
                                                "text": "This elementary instruction is language at its most advanced to minds trained on the accentuation of the antepenult (multiplicity) and on Sievers-type C2 half-line metrical patterns[.]"
